<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Material Symbols "sticky_note_2", outlined — DESIGN.md §9, added by P2-21.

  The grid tile's mark for a note, and the note editor's. **Not ic_description**,
  which is P2-18's FILE glyph: one glyph per kind and never two kinds under one
  glyph, §6.4 — a note and an imported text file are different items and the tile
  is where a user tells them apart.

  A vector drawable rather than material-icons-core, which is not on the Compose
  classpath and would be a new dependency plus an I1 clearance for a handful of
  glyphs. See ic_play_circle.xml, the first of these.
-->
